  TMUX KEYBINDS CHEATSHEET        prefix = C-a
  ════════════════════════════════════════════

  SESSIONS & WINDOWS
  prefix + c          New window (cwd)
  prefix + ,          Rename window
  prefix + &          Kill window
  prefix + s          List sessions
  prefix + $          Rename session
  prefix + d          Detach session
  prefix + 0-9        Switch window

  PANES
  prefix + |          Split vertical (cwd)
  prefix + -          Split horizontal (cwd)
  prefix + h/j/k/l    Navigate panes
  prefix + H/J/K/L    Resize pane (repeatable)
  prefix + x          Kill pane
  prefix + z          Zoom pane (toggle fullscreen)
  prefix + {/}        Swap pane left/right

  COPY MODE
  prefix + Enter      Enter copy mode
  v                   Begin selection
  y                   Copy to clipboard
  q                   Quit copy mode

  OTHER
  prefix + r          Reload tmux config
  prefix + /          Show this help
  prefix + ?          List all keybinds
  prefix + :          Command prompt
